 "description": "Record late terms: grace days, and a basis of none, flat_fee, or percent_per_period. flat_fee uses feeMinor and a percent of 0. percent_per_period uses percent and a fee of 0. After approval, a different basis, grace, fee, or percent is refused until an accepted revise_late_terms suggestion.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
